68eb435 exp_07 record: check_record refuses the repointed `final` as well
The round-11 reproduction saved a valid report first and then repointed `final`
at a hardlink of the checkpoint, and both the fresh collection and
`check_record.py` accepted it.  `check_record.py` recomputes through `collect`,
so the guard already covers it; the test now says so in the order that failed,
report first.

